.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE
.idea
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.vscode/

# Gradle
.gradle/
build/
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
# A pipeline stage named `build` is source, not Gradle output: without this the
# e2e-program fixture's stage manifest was never committed, and a fresh clone
# (CI) failed ProgramStageContainerE2eSpec with "stage 'build' has no manifest".
!**/.gnomish/stages/build/

# Java
*.class
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

uncommitted-files.md

# Factory-run artifacts of this clone (the factory jar is built, not committed)
/logs/
temporary-docs
